  },
  "id": "GL-DEFECT-001",
  "law": "A kh:Hook admitted by the engine whose trigger matches the event delta yields a verdict; an engine that extracted no hook must not report ADMITTED as if hooks were evaluated.",
  "praxis_head_build": {
    "artifact_sha256": "5903ea9d96d45ff04c05935643ef548be9312eb3375a1c3e83901936f697ff55",
    "praxis_git_sha": "31f149dd8a6d6b4ff25f27ba24b53759c20954c9",
    "record": "priv/graphlaw/defects/praxis-head-refresh.json"
  },
  "root_cause": [
    {
      "evidence": "executed: native probe TripleStore::from(preprocess_turtle(hook pack)) -> triples=6 hooks=0",
      "finding": "TripleStore::from discards every hook extraction/compilation error: validate_and_extract_hooks(..).and_then(compile_hooks).unwrap_or_default() -> post_store.hooks is empty",
      "lines": "257-259",
      "path": "crates/praxis-graphlaw/src/lib.rs",
      "praxis_git_sha": "31f149dd8a6d6b4ff25f27ba24b53759c20954c9"
    },
    {
      "evidence": "executed: validate_and_extract_hooks -> Err(hook:on must be assert, retract, or any, got: \"assert\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>)",
      "finding": "preprocess_turtle always prepends @prefix, so TripleStore::from takes the pest N3 path (lib.rs:194-219), which yields typed literals \"assert\"^^<xsd:string>; HookProps::new keeps clean_term(object), and clean_term strips quotes only when the term also ends with a quote, so kh:on is rejected",
      "lines": "16-24, 78, 278-283",
      "path": "crates/praxis-graphlaw/src/hooks/parsing.rs",
      "praxis_git_sha": "31f149dd8a6d6b4ff25f27ba24b53759c20954c9"
    },
    {
      "evidence": "executed: iri variant -> Err(SHACL validation failed: 5x sh:DatatypeConstraintComponent)",
      "finding": "IRI-valued hook properties pass clean_term but fail the hook SHACL law pack, so no spelling of a hook is extractable on this path",
      "lines": "13 (SHACL_LAW_PACK, sh:datatype xsd:string)",
      "path": "crates/praxis-graphlaw/src/hooks/mod.rs",
      "praxis_git_sha": "31f149dd8a6d6b4ff25f27ba24b53759c20954c9"
    },
    {
      "evidence": "read-only source inspection",
      "finding": "run_hooks_core_impl returns status: Status::Admitted unconditionally",
      "lines": "505-517",
      "path": "crates/praxis-graphlaw-wasm/src/core.rs",
      "praxis_git_sha": "31f149dd8a6d6b4ff25f27ba24b53759c20954c9"
    }
  ],
  "schema": "ash_a2a.graphlaw.defect/v1",
  "status": "BLOCKED_ON_PRAXIS",
  "title": "run_hooks/2 never fires a kh:Hook: ADMITTED with zero verdicts for a matching hook pack"
}
